WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,060
Look at your clothes

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:04,140
Probably the community security guard

3
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,780
This pure trickster only needs to sign a contract with you.

4
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,060
He is the owner of your community

5
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:12,580
You have to protect him, right?

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,540
You're a hairy beast, you're pretty smart.

7
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,860
That's the truth

8
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:21,170
Follow humans closely

9
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:23,650
Did you sign this rental contract?

10
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:25,250
I'd like to see it

11
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,970
This human being doesn’t even have any ghost energy at all

12
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,730
How can I protect you?

13
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:34,070
I am a magnificent coral

14
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,070
How could he be cooperating with some human being?

15
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,990
What rental contract to sign?
